OL,3,GNEWSAEx-councillor guilty of running
OL,4,Asham Covid-19 lab
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of running a bogus coronavirus
OL,8,Ftesting laboratory during the Covid-19
OL,9,Fpandemic.
OL,11,FFaisal Shoukat, who served on
OL,12,FCalderdale Council, was convicted of
OL,13,Fcausing public nuisance, fraudulent
OL,14,Ftrading and money laundering after a
OL,15,Ftrial at Bradford Crown Court.
OL,17,FFour other people on trial alongside
OL,18,FShoukat - former justice minister
OL,19,FShahid Malik, Lynn Connell, Paul Moore
OL,20,Fand Dr Alexander Zarneh - were cleared
OL,21,Fof any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
